      ":question/problem": "![](images/9f/9fbbc1f08c3071d0277d06962b7defc5ff45df7a6cb8bfc3d336f50116d0ce55.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, $\u2220OAC$ and $\u2220OBD$ are right angles, and $O$ is the midpoint of $AB^(\u2015)$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $\u25b3OAC\u2245\u25b3OBD$\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $\u2220OAC$ is a right angle | Given |\n| 2 | $\u2220OBD$ is a right angle | Given |\n| 3 | $O$ is the midpoint of $AB^(\u2015)$ | Given |\n| 4 | $OA^(\u2015)\u2245OB^(\u2015)$ | Definition of a midpoint |\n| 5 | $\u2220OAC\u2245\u2220OBD$ | {{field-1}} |\n| 6 | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |\n| 7 | $\u25b3OAC\u2245\u25b3OBD$ | {{field-4}} |"
    },
