      ":question/problem": "![](images/e2/e2b65dd80261a49cfa9ecfaeb615e29347d028991230e2b6f5bcbf7ef0bc571c.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, $\u2220ACB$ and $\u2220ADB$ are right angles and $BC^(\u2015)\u2245BD^(\u2015)$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $\u25b3ACB\u2245\u25b3ADB$\n\nThe table below provides proof of the statement. Select the correct options to complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $\u2220ACB$ is a right angle | Given |\n| 2 | $\u2220ADB$ is a right angle | Given |\n| 3 | {{field-1}} | Given |\n| 4 | $AB^(\u2015)\u2245AB^(\u2015)$ | {{field-2}} |\n| 5 | $\u25b3ACB\u2245\u25b3ADB$ | {{field-3}} |"
